(text "External PSU 24.0 V, max 25 V. J101: 1 = +24 V, 2 = GND.\nFuse coordination and reverse polarity survival are NOT qualified.\nL7987 is the 3 A part. VCC is on 24 V; VBIAS is on the regulated 12 V rail.\nRF + CF series from COMP to FB; CP across the complete RF/CF network.\nC112 has 0.1 ohm in series to GND. This is deliberate compensation damping." (at 12.7 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5d7257aa-3eaa-5dda-aad5-36acde20f49b"))
